===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|carbohydrate|pharmaceutical drug}} A [[compound]] occurring in the [[liver]] and other tissues which inhibits blood [[coagulation]]. A [[sulfur]]-containing [[polysaccharide]], it is used as an [[anticoagulant]] in the treatment of [[thrombosis]].

